projects.description:
The Strategic Plan for Agricultural and Rural Statistics (SPARS) document is completed and endorsed by national authorities. The development of SPARS in Namibia would: 
i)	guarantee a better coverage for agricultural and rural statistics for the country; 
ii)	respond to regional and international requirements; 
iii)	ensure that mechanisms for a good integration of the agricultural sector into the existing and future Strategic Plans of the Namibia Statistics Agency (NSA) are in place; and  
iv)	improve administrative data for agriculture statistics by improving the presentation, consistency, quality and accessibility.
